{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41668","headline":"闲居寄太学卢景博士 · 陈陶","name":"闲居寄太学卢景博士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无路青冥夺锦袍，耻随黄雀住蓬蒿。\n碧云梦後山风起，珠树诗成海月高。\n久滞鼎书求羽翼，未忘龙阙致波涛。\n闲来长得留侯癖，罗列樝梨校六韬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}